    "objective": "Execute a deliberate miss that hits the rim and win the offensive rebound for a tying basket.",
    "setup": "Shooter at the line; offensive and defensive players in lane spots.",
    "organization": "Rotate shooters; run six times.",
    "instructions": [
      "The shooter aims hard at the front of the rim (or the side) to create a long rebound.",
      "Lane attackers spin to the middle on the release.",
      "The player nearest the expected landing spot calls 'Mine!'.",
      "Put back or tip immediately.",
      "The shot must hit the rim or it is a violation."
    ],
    "coachingPoints": [
      "The miss must hit the rim.",
